      "score": 1.0,
      "text": "We were able to conduct NADIR research in Minneapolis on Tues PM. Unfortunately, we had to postpone our LA research until 2/7-2/8. The following is a quick update & summary of next steps:"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "region_type": "text",
      "bbox": [
