        ]
      ],
      "score": 0.7468349144620281,
      "text": "The Minneapolis groups consisted of 6 groups: UL smokers 21-40, UL Smokers 4O-55, Free Standing UL & Lts Smokers, UL & Lts line extension smokers, UL & Lts smokers 21-40, Menthol smokers (incl FF). Fo"
    },
