      "score": 1.0,
      "text": "All goups were interested in the concept although the younger smokers (21-40) were more receptive than those 40-55. I would also say that the Lts smokers were more interested than the UL smokers. This"
    },
    {
      "node_id": 5,
      "region_type": "text",
      "bbox": [
        [
          128,
          1341
        ],
        [
          1491,
          1341
        ],
        [
          1491,
          1606
        ],
        [
          128,
          1606
        ]
      ],
      "score": 0.7494121378959899,
      "text": "All of B&W's trademarks tested badly in all six groups. In all cases, the groups felt that the proposition belonged on a new mark and 2-3 were consistently selected from the list: Santa Fe, Vancouver "
    },
    {
