      ],
      "score": 0.7231506849315068,
      "text": "Carlton/Tareyton - these are terrible cigarettes so their all natural offerings must taste terrible too. These marks reinforced the concern."
    },
    {
      "node_id": 8,
      "region_type": "text",
      "bbox": [
        [
          125,
